and make $15 million a year,

07:15.060 --> 07:17.227
while you would work steadily
for 20 years,

07:17.228 --> 07:19.063
lose all your hair and go bankrupt?

07:19.064 --> 07:21.190
- Whoa!
- There it is!

07:21.191 --> 07:24.445
Yeah, that's the...
That's the thing I wanted.

07:29.449 --> 07:30.866
Where's Dad?

07:30.867 --> 07:32.660
<i>You've got male porn!</i>

07:32.661 --> 07:35.079
Peter, get in here and finish the story!

07:35.080 --> 07:37.998
Sorry, I was just watching
some guy take it in the AOL.

07:37.999 --> 07:40.084
<i>- Goodbye.
- All right, where were we?</i>

07:40.085 --> 07:43.087
Mom just said
she got engaged to Tom Tucker?

07:43.088 --> 07:45.798
Well, deep down,
I knew I loved your father,

07:45.799 --> 07:48.550
but I guess I just caved
to my father's pressure.

07:48.551 --> 07:50.552
And on my 28th birthday,

07:50.553 --> 07:53.888
<i>he introduced me to my future husband.</i>

08:04.024 --> 08:09.571
<i>He's your king-to-be</i>

08:09.572 --> 08:13.617
<i>A king to be forever</i>

08:13.618 --> 08:17.287
<i>A king who'll do whatever</i>

08:17.288 --> 08:20.082
<i>Her Highness</i>

08:20.083 --> 08:23.670
<i>Desires</i>

08:23.671 --> 08:28.925
<i>He's your king-to-be...</i>

08:30.760 --> 08:31.844
Thanks, Ollie.

08:31.845 --> 08:33.721
Good afternoon, Lois. I'm Tom Tucker,

08:33.722 --> 08:34.888
your king-to-be.

08:34.889 --> 08:36.223
In other news,

08:36.224 --> 08:38.726
President Clinton sent me
a congratulatory cigar,

08:38.727 --> 08:40.644
but it's a little moist.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.730
<i>Well, I wasn't
gonna give up that easily.</i>

08:42.731 --> 08:45.399
<i>So I decided I was gonna do
the most powerful thing</i>

08:45.400 --> 08:48.402
<i>you could do in the '90s:
make a mixtape.</i>

08:48.403 --> 08:50.404
Again, Peter, it's your mixtape,

08:50.405 --> 08:53.240
but you've got "Cotton Eye Joe"
as song number two,

08:53.241 --> 08:55.075
number four, seven and eight.

08:55.076 --> 08:56.493
You think it should be
number three as well?

08:56.494 --> 08:57.578
No!

08:57.579 --> 08:59.455
<i>I made it number three as well.</i>

08:59.456 --> 09:01.248
Oh, Peter, I got to say,

09:01.249 --> 09:03.751
the fourth and fifth time
I heard "Cotton Eye Joe,"

09:03.752 --> 09:05.419
it really got to me.

09:05.420 --> 09:07.755
<i>I was so happy.</i>

09:07.756 --> 09:09.173
<i>I knew Peter was the one</i>

09:09.174 --> 09:11.759
<i>I wanted to spend
the rest of my life with.</i>

09:11.760 --> 09:14.303
<i>But I dreaded having to tell my father.</i>

09:14.304 --> 09:17.347
<i>Luckily, he was remarkably
understanding about it.</i>

09:17.348 --> 09:20.142
I've decided to be remarkably
understanding about this.

09:20.143 --> 09:22.436
- Really?
- Yes. And to prove it,

09:22.437 --> 09:24.605
I'm going to pay
for Peter's bachelor party

09:24.606 --> 09:26.148
