for Peter once and for all.

09:30.779 --> 09:32.529
Oh, Daddy, thank you!

09:32.530 --> 09:33.989
<i>I was thrilled.</i>

09:33.990 --> 09:36.450
<i>Not only was
Carter letting me marry Lois,</i>

09:36.451 --> 09:39.787
<i>but this was gonna be
the ultimate bachelor party.</i>

09:39.788 --> 09:41.872
<i>The MTV Beach House was located</i>

09:41.873 --> 09:44.333
<i>in the most hepatitis-rich part
