09:44.334 --> 09:45.960
<i>known as Florida.</i>

09:46.793 --> 09:48.337
Whassup?!

09:48.338 --> 09:50.047
Commercials.

09:50.048 --> 09:52.216
No skipping those yet.

09:52.217 --> 09:54.968
<i>We partied the same way
everyone in the '90s did,</i>

09:54.969 --> 09:56.845
<i>spaced apart by a few feet,</i>

09:56.846 --> 09:58.639
<i>dancing on our own.</i>

09:58.640 --> 10:01.183
<i>Yeah, I was pretty
much the coolest guy there.</i>

10:01.184 --> 10:02.810
<i>With the best legs.</i>

10:02.811 --> 10:05.312
<i>There were these other idiots
there having a bachelor party,</i>

10:05.313 --> 10:06.814
<i>but I didn't know 'em. They were losers.</i>

10:06.815 --> 10:08.857
<i>- Joe?
- Who's that? Peter?</i>

10:08.858 --> 10:10.818
<i>Yeah, get out of my story.
What the hell are you doing?</i>

10:10.819 --> 10:14.321
<i>I'm telling the story of my
days at the MTV Beach House.</i>

10:14.322 --> 10:15.906
<i>You get out of my story!</i>

10:15.907 --> 10:18.284
<i>I'm about to tell how I met Daria.</i>

10:19.494 --> 10:23.038
So, you partying hard
