10:23.039 --> 10:24.748
Hardly interested.

10:24.749 --> 10:26.041
You're mean!

10:28.169 --> 10:30.379
<i>La-la-la-la-la</i>

10:30.380 --> 10:33.465
<i>La-la-la-la-la.</i>

10:33.466 --> 10:35.134
<i>I even got to meet my heroes,</i>

10:35.135 --> 10:38.095
<i>Mark McGrath, Pauly Shore
and Jamie Kennedy,</i>

10:38.096 --> 10:39.721
<i>and we became friends.</i>

10:39.722 --> 10:41.515
Guys, come be in my wedding.

10:41.516 --> 10:43.767
Then we can all enter the 2000s
together as friends.

10:43.768 --> 10:45.853
Sorry, Peter, but we can't go with you.

10:45.854 --> 10:47.396
We're not allowed in the 2000s.

10:47.397 --> 10:50.149
Yeah, we have to stay back here
in the '90s.

10:50.150 --> 10:52.651
<i>- Goodbye, Peter.
- And then,</i>

10:52.652 --> 10:55.696
<i>they all walked into the sea
and disappeared forever.</i>

10:55.697 --> 10:57.114
Tell the world about us!

10:57.115 --> 10:58.448
<i>I planned to,</i>

10:58.449 --> 11:00.409
<i>but then I found a half-eaten hot dog</i>

11:00.410 --> 11:02.744
<i>that only had a little bit
of sand on it.</i>

11:02.745 --> 11:04.913
<i>And most of the sand was very brushable.</i>

11:04.914 --> 11:07.416
<i>You can pretty much wash
a hot dog with soap and water,</i>

11:07.417 --> 11:08.959
<i>and you can still eat it.</i>

11:08.960 --> 11:11.795
<i>I danced for eight hours
straight on The Grind,</i>

11:11.796 --> 11:14.298
<i>occasionally going into the pool to pee.</i>

11:14.299 --> 11:16.383
<i>Also, for some reason,
I was the only guy</i>

11:16.384 --> 11:18.552
<i>a bee was following the whole time.</i>

11:18.553 --> 11:20.721
<i>Maybe it was 'cause of the
Country Time Lemonade powder</i>

11:20.722 --> 11:22.931
<i>I'd been eating,
or 'cause me and Quagmire</i>

11:22.932 --> 11:24.933
<i>were huckin' Capri Suns at each other.</i>

11:24.934 --> 11:27.269
<i>But little did I know,
while I was dancing</i>

11:27.270 --> 11:29.229
<i>and periodically peeing in the pool,</i>

