11:31.441 --> 11:34.943
<i>to destroy my relationship
with your mom once and for all.</i>

11:34.944 --> 11:36.778
Hey, you're Daisy Fuentes.

11:36.779 --> 11:39.573
<i>Oh, that's how I say my last name.</i>

11:39.574 --> 11:41.992
You're the hottest girl of 1990-this.

11:41.993 --> 11:44.119
I've got a proposition for you.

11:48.917 --> 11:51.752
<i>Hey, there. You're all that
and a bag of chips.</i>

11:51.753 --> 11:53.670
What a cool phrase.

11:53.671 --> 11:56.673
I hope it never sounds dumb and dated.

12:01.763 --> 12:05.307
Look, Peter's wrestling
with Daisy Foo-en-taze!

12:10.271 --> 12:12.606
<i>It all happened so fast.</i>

12:12.607 --> 12:16.485
Oh. We're having fun
'cause it's not 9/11 yet. Mmm.

12:16.486 --> 12:18.278
<i>But the next thing I knew,</i>

12:18.279 --> 12:20.280
<i>I was kissing Daisy Fuentes.</i>

